 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2022-07-12",
   "text": "Public Health Air Quality Act of 2022\n This bill requires the Environmental Protection Agency to take specified actions related to monitoring and improving air quality, including by implementing a program to administer or conduct emissions measurement and quantification, promulgating regulations related to specified source categories, and deploying not fewer than 1,000 air quality sensors."
  }
